      "title": "Intelligent Operations at Enterprise Scale - with Dhrubojyoti Das Deb of JPMorganChase",
      "summary": "Alert volume inside IT operations has outpaced manual triage, leaving real incidents buried in noise. In this episode, Dhrubojyoti Das Deb , SVP of Global IT at JPMorgan Chase & Co., explores how AI-driven correlation and intelligent grouping can turn thousands of alerts into a handful of actionable incidents. The conversation covers where accountability sits when AI assists in triage, how teams build trust in automation incrementally, and where leaders should start when moving from reactive firefighting to intelligent operations. This episode is sponsored by BigPanda . Learn how to build high-converting landing pages and use self-qualification systems to identify and prioritize high-intent leads. Download our free B2B AI Lead Generation Guide at emerj.com/aig1",
      "summary_html": "Alert volume inside IT operations has outpaced manual triage, leaving real incidents buried in noise. In this episode, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/dhrubojyoti-das-deb-18ab1a13/\">Dhrubojyoti Das Deb</a>, SVP of Global IT at JPMorgan Chase &amp; Co., explores how AI-driven correlation and intelligent grouping can turn thousands of alerts into a handful of actionable incidents. The conversation covers where accountability sits when AI assists in triage, how teams build trust in automation incrementally, and where leaders should start when moving from reactive firefighting to intelligent operations. This episode is sponsored by <a href=\"https://www.bigpanda.io/\">BigPanda</a>. Learn how to build high-converting landing pages and use self-qualification systems to identify and prioritize high-intent leads. Download our free B2B AI Lead Generation Guide at <a href=\"http://emerj.com/aig1\">emerj.com/aig1</a>",
